From c3b4b048b3610ad795cac20a3bda45c8fe14f67e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bormotoon <bormotoon@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 19:37:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(export): preserve measured timeline placement

Park unresolved clips after measured footage so guessed positions cannot displace aligned camera material.

Export overlapping primary-camera clips as connected clips, distinguish container and picture durations, trim clips to available media, and resolve relative paths from the final project directory.

Add regression coverage for overlap layout, asset durations, staged documents, and unresolved placement.
